The Android implementation in this repository is a modified version produced for
the Badge Collection project.  Modifications include: a Kotlin/Android rewrite of
the user interface and storage layer, an offline-only data model with no network
code path, removal of the cloud-sync, link-distribution and card-writing
capabilities, and the addition of a delivery/cooldown workflow.

